---
import SiteLayout from "../../layouts/IssaLayout.astro";
import "../../styles/shop.css";
---

<SiteLayout title="Fukamushi sencha | Issa Green" description="Fukamushi sencha | Issa Green">
<section class="pdp">
    <div class="section-wrap">
      <nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span>›</span><a href="/shop-tea">Tea</a><span>›</span><span aria-current="page">Fukamushi sencha</span></nav>
      <div class="pdp-grid">
        <div class="pdp-gallery">
          <div class="pdp-main"><img id="pdp-main" src="/images/shop/fukamushi-sencha-bags.jpg" alt="Fukamushi sencha"></div>
          <div class="pdp-thumbs" id="pdp-thumbs"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="pdp-info">
          <div class="pdp-ribbons"><span class="pdp-ribbon">Best seller</span></div>
          <h1>Fukamushi sencha</h1>
          <p class="pdp-sub">Sencha · Sugimoto farm · Shizuoka</p>
          <div class="pdp-price" id="pdp-price" aria-live="polite"></div>
          <div class="pdp-opt" id="pdp-opt"></div>
          <div class="pdp-buy">
            <div class="qty" role="group" aria-label="Quantity"><button type="button" id="q-dec" aria-label="Decrease quantity">−</button><output id="q-out" aria-live="polite">1</output><button type="button" id="q-inc" aria-label="Increase quantity">+</button></div>
            <button class="pdp-add" id="pdp-add" type="button"></button>
          </div>
          <p class="pdp-msg" id="pdp-msg" role="alert" hidden></p>
          <p class="pdp-note">Shipping and taxes calculated at checkout. <a href="/shipping">Shipping &amp; returns</a></p>
          <p class="pdp-lead">ISSA GREEN&#x27;s signature tea. This sencha is produced by steaming leaves two to three times longer than regular varieties — creating a uniquely rich, smooth cup.</p>
          <div class="pdp-tags"><span class="pdp-tag t0">Health &amp; Beauty</span><span class="pdp-tag t1">Regular caffeine</span><span class="pdp-tag t2">Rich flavor</span></div>
          <div class="acc-list"><div class="acc"><button class="acc-btn" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="acc0">About this tea<span aria-hidden="true"></span></button><div class="acc-panel" id="acc0" role="region"><div class="acc-in"><p>The steaming process makes tea leaves finer, and insoluble nutrition (fiber, protein, β-carotene, vitamin E, chlorophyll and minerals) is released from the powdery part of the tea. Rich in catechin, vitamin C, vitamin B2, tannin, flavonoid, gamma-aminobutyric acid, pectin, saponin, polysaccharide, fluorine and caffeine. We recommend a cup of fukamushi tea in the morning for immune support and a beauty booster!</p></div></div></div><div class="acc"><button class="acc-btn" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="acc1">How to brew<span aria-hidden="true"></span></button><div class="acc-panel" id="acc1" role="region"><div class="acc-in"><p>1 tsp / 250–500 ml. Hot: 80°C · 1 min. Cold brew: 2–4 hours or overnight.</p></div></div></div><div class="acc"><button class="acc-btn" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="acc2">Product details<span aria-hidden="true"></span></button><div class="acc-panel" id="acc2" role="region"><div class="acc-in"><p><strong>Ingredients</strong> Organic green tea</p><p><strong>Producer</strong> Sugimoto farm</p><p><strong>Available</strong> Tea bags, Loose tea 80g</p></div></div></div><div class="acc"><button class="acc-btn" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="acc3">Shipping info<span aria-hidden="true"></span></button><div class="acc-panel" id="acc3" role="region"><div class="acc-in"><p><strong>Calgary</strong> Within Calgary city limit: $7 flat rate. Free delivery over $75.</p><p><strong>Rest of Canada</strong> $12 flat rate shipping by Canada Post or courier service. Free shipping over $150.</p><p>If you prefer another shipping method, please do not hesitate to contact us. We will arrange a special shipment.</p></div></div></div><div class="acc"><button class="acc-btn" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="acc4">Return &amp; refund policy<span aria-hidden="true"></span></button><div class="acc-panel" id="acc4" role="region"><div class="acc-in"><p><strong>Tea</strong> Due to the character of our products, we cannot accept returns or refunds of packaged tea and food.</p><p><strong>Tea ware &amp; goods</strong> We accept returns and issue a gift card for the same amount as the purchased goods. Customers pay the postage for returns.</p><p>Please inform us about defects immediately by email at <a href="mailto:issagreentea@gmail.com">issagreentea@gmail.com</a>. We will make an exchange as soon as possible.</p><p>Most of our products are handcrafted and have unique characters. We are happy to tell you the exact condition of each item before shipping. Please leave the request on the checkout page.</p></div></div></div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="pdp-rel"><div class="section-wrap"><p class="section-label">More tea</p><div class="rel-grid"><a class="rel-card" href="/products/premium-sencha"><span class="rel-img"><img src="/images/shop/premium-sencha-80g.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"></span><span class="rel-name">Premium sencha</span><span class="rel-price">$24.50</span></a><a class="rel-card" href="/products/gyokuro"><span class="rel-img"><img src="/images/shop/gyokuro-30g.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"></span><span class="rel-name">Gyokuro</span><span class="rel-price">Out of stock</span></a><a class="rel-card" href="/products/fukamushi-genmaicha"><span class="rel-img"><img src="/images/shop/fukamushi-genmaicha-80g.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"></span><span class="rel-name">Fukamushi Genmaicha</span><span class="rel-price">From $19.80</span></a><a class="rel-card" href="/products/ceremonial-matcha"><span class="rel-img"><img src="/images/shop/ceremonial-matcha-30g.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"></span><span class="rel-name">Ceremonial Matcha 30g</span><span class="rel-price">$25.00</span></a></div>
    <p style="text-align:center;margin-top:36px"><a class="btn-explore" href="/shop-tea">All tea</a></p></div></section>
  
  
<script is:inline>window.PDP = {"name": "Fukamushi sencha", "optname": "Format", "variants": [{"id": "fukamushi-sencha-tea-bags", "label": "Tea bags", "price": 22.0, "was": null, "soldout": false, "img": "/images/shop/fukamushi-sencha-bags.jpg", "imgs": ["/images/shop/fukamushi-sencha-bags.jpg", "/images/shop/fukamushi-sencha-bags-hover.jpg"], "name": "Fukamushi sencha", "variant": "Tea bags"}, {"id": "fukamushi-sencha-loose-tea-80g", "label": "Loose tea 80g", "price": 26.5, "was": null, "soldout": false, "img": "/images/shop/fukamushi-sencha-80g.jpg", "imgs": ["/images/shop/fukamushi-sencha-80g.jpg", "/images/shop/fukamushi-sencha-80g-hover.jpg"], "name": "Fukamushi sencha", "variant": "Loose tea 80g"}]};</script>
<script is:inline src="/pdp.js"></script>
</SiteLayout>
